      </trkpt>
      <trkpt lat="34.746108" lon="-119.70231">
        <ele>962.60</ele>
        <time>2025-03-07T15:22:15Z</time>
        <desc>i want to stay the night, but the next section has no trail, and i have already been so wet with trail and nice camps, i’m scared to be wetter</desc>
